3. Use of the website and of exported data

Use of the GeoID website (https://geoidinitiative.com), including GeoHUB, is
governed by its Terms of Service at https://geoidinitiative.com/terms/.

What people take away from GeoHUB is not part of the Software, and this
licence does not restrict it. The Terms set out its two kinds: outputs users
make with the tools from open, third-party or their own data, which are
theirs and need no attribution to GeoID; and GeoID Data Products (the hazard
maps and other datasets GeoID computes), which may be used with citation but
not resold or redistributed as datasets. Using GeoHUB or exporting data gives
no right to the Software that produced it.

